# liteDS-v2 input script - ARMWrestler DS (mic-, 2006 / Atem2069 fixed build).
# From the test menu (ARM ALU highlighted) START runs the selected suite;
# on a results page START='Next page', SELECT='Menu'. Pulsing START pages
# through the full ARM instruction suite - ARM ALU pt1, ALU pt2/MISC,
# ARM LDR/STR, ARM LDM/STM - then wraps, cycling deterministically. Every
# subtest reports OK. 600-frame run; interp and JIT are byte-identical.
# Format: '<frame> <keys>' = hold exactly those keys from that frame on.

